OL,3,GNEWSAPlans revived for 4,000-home
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landowner has revived plans for a new
OL,7,Fvillage of about 4,000 homes in
OL,8,FShropshire, four years after a similar
OL,9,Fproposal failed to secure a place in
OL,10,Fthe county's Local Plan.
OL,12,FBradford Estates said the development,
OL,13,Fknown as Weston and proposed on land
OL,14,Fnear Tong, close to the M54, could
OL,15,Finclude schools, a GP surgery, shops
OL,16,Fand employment land, supporting up to
OL,17,F8,000 jobs.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
