OL,3,GNEWSAPlans revived for 4,000-home
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said the scheme would help
OL,7,FShropshire meet future housing needs,
OL,8,Fbut campaigners opposed to building on
OL,9,Fgreen belt land said brownfield sites
OL,10,Fshould be developed first.
OL,12,FThe proposal is still at an early
OL,13,Fstage, according to Dominic Stanford,
OL,14,Fspeaking on behalf of the Viscount and
OL,15,FViscountess Newport, who own the
OL,16,Festate.
